[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-study-in-saudi-scholarships-for-international-students-2026-fully-funded-200":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},200,"study-in-saudi-scholarships-for-international-students-2026-fully-funded-200","Study In Saudi Scholarships For International Students 2026: Fully Funded","\u003Cp>Study in Saudi Scholarships: Shall we explore the possibility of a fully-funded scholarship in Asia?\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Applications are now being accepted from all qualified and interested international students for the 2026 Study in Saudi Scholarships for International Students.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>International Students Scholarship in Saudi Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: Saudi Government\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-asia\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study-In-Asia\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Saudi Arabia\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fundergraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Undergraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> ||  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fphd-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">PhD Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Living Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Visa\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Medical Insurance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: May 21, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Study in Saudi Scholarships Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Kingdom of Saudi Arabia boasts over 50 public and private universities, ranked among the world’s best according to internationally recognized rankings, most notably the Times Higher \u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fstudy-in-saudi-scholarships\u002F#\"> \u003Cu>Education\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fa> ranking.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>These universities offer diverse educational programs for students, researchers, and trainees, along with student visas that provide excellent opportunities to pursue various academic and professional degrees.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>This scholarship includes all international students from outside the Kingdom, in addition to graduate students residing in Saudi Arabia, according to the unified admission schedule.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Study in Saudi Scholarships for International Students 2026 Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Study in Saudi Scholarships for International Students 2026 offers:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Full tuition coverage\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Access to modern academic facilities\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Opportunity to study in internationally ranked universities\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Exposure to global academic and cultural environments.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Available Programmes for DAAD EPOS Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>For the 2023\u002F24 academic session, the Shanghai Government Scholarship will accept applications to the following programmes;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The first category includes: philosophy, economics, law, \u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fstudy-in-saudi-scholarships\u002F#\"> \u003Cu>education\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fa>, literature, history, and management;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The second category includes: science, engineering, and agriculture; the third category includes: medicine and art.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Participating Universities for DAAD EPOS Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Imam Muhammad ibn Saud Islamic University\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>King Saud University\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Princess Nourah bint Abdulrahman University\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Northern Border University\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>King Khalid University\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Al Yamamah Private University\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Prince Fahd Bin Sultan University\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>College of Medical Care\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Dar Al-Hekma Private University\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Scholarship essay writing\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>And many other universities in Saudi Arabia\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Study in Saudi Scholarships Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the undergraduate and postgraduate Study in Saudi Scholarships, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Minimum age of 16 years\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A valid international passport\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Academic certificates and transcripts\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Proof of admission (for some programmes)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Medical clearance (for long-term programmes)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Health insurance (where applicable)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>International Students Scholarship in Saudi Required Documents\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the 2026 Study in Saudi Scholarships, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Complete Application Form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Academic Transcripts\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Bachelors\u002F Diploma Certificate (Masters)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Personal Statement\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Recommendation Letters\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Passport\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for Study in Saudi Scholarships\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the International Students Scholarship in Saudi, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Prepare necessary documents\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Visit the “Study in Saudi Arabia” platform to register\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Apply Here: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstudyinsaudi.sa\u002Far\">https:\u002F\u002Fstudyinsaudi.sa\u002Far\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-05-02 13:06:43",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fstudy-in-saudi-scholarships-for-international-students-2026-fully-funded\u002F69f5e8d3a691a5.12922090_screenshot 2026-05-02 112333.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fstudy-in-saudi-scholarships-for-international-students-2026-fully-funded\u002F69f5e8d3a691a5.12922090_screenshot%202026-05-02%20112333.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,47,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,"oldFileName":34,"type":18,"file":19,"url":35},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-06-24 20:51:19","LINKSKOOL",{"id":39,"slug":40,"title":41,"images":42,"datePosted":46,"authorName":9},304,"mexican-govern